    "notes": "Inspected all 26 medium-fi views: street/block/skyline at noon and late afternoon in Economy/High, an untextured silhouette, five architectural details, all four complete-ruin levels and transitions. Levels 662/2110/5150/10869 triangles retain all eight column positions, open bays, U-shaped entablature, broken upper masonry and roofless podium. District adds profiles and coarse Ionic scrolls; street adds chamber recesses, selected cornice stones and loose rubble; closeup adds recessed readable inscription geometry, selected rear frieze lobes and repaired shaft joints. Initial skyline plus district geometry totals 281868 bytes, plus five reused common graphs. Separate attribute streams avoid duplicate GPU uploads. Physical-device and dense-city measurements remain pending.",
